=== obc-P1 (rejection): non-output ORDER BY column ===
ORDER BY column 'o_totalprice' in CTE body 't' must be one of the body's output columns.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE body ORDER BY column is not a body output.

=== obc-P2 (rejection): string MIN/MAX output as ORDER BY key ===
ORDER BY over string MIN/MAX output 'm' in CTE body 't' is not yet supported.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE body ORDER BY over a string MIN/MAX output.

=== obc-P3 (rejection): LIMIT 0 on a scalar body ===
LIMIT 0 in scalar aggregate CTE body 'm' is not supported (use a WHERE clause that matches no rows instead).
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: LIMIT 0 on a scalar CTE body.

=== obc-P4 (rejection): 9 ORDER BY entries (kernel max is 8) ===
ORDER BY in CTE body 't' has 9 columns; at most 8 are supported.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Too many ORDER BY columns in CTE body.

=== obc-P5 (rejection): LIMIT above the 26-bit immediate ===
LIMIT 67108864 in CTE body 't' exceeds the supported maximum (67108863).
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE body LIMIT value too large.

=== obc-P6 (syntax): OFFSET is not in the grammar ===
Syntax error in SQL statement: Unimplemented keyword. If this was intended as an identifier, use backtick quotation.
> WITH t AS (SELECT o_custkey AS k, COUNT(*) AS n FROM orders GROUP BY o_custkey ORDER BY k LIMIT 5 OFFSET 2) SELECT COUNT(*) AS c FROM customer AS cu JOIN t ON t.k = cu.c_custkey;
!                                                                                                   ^^^^^^
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Syntax error.

=== obc-P7 (syntax): LIMIT x,y comma form is not in the grammar ===
Syntax error in SQL statement: Unexpected at this point
> WITH t AS (SELECT o_custkey AS k, COUNT(*) AS n FROM orders GROUP BY o_custkey ORDER BY k LIMIT 2,5) SELECT COUNT(*) AS c FROM customer AS cu JOIN t ON t.k = cu.c_custkey;
!                                                                                                  ^
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Syntax error.
